{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":54,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华对以色列的爱"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"你这不怀孕、不生养的要歌唱；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你这未曾经过产难的要发声歌唱，扬声欢呼；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为没有丈夫的比有丈夫的儿女更多。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要扩张你帐幕之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"张大你居所的幔子，不要限止；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要放长你的绳子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"坚固你的橛子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你要向左向右开展；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的后裔必得多国为业，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又使荒凉的城邑有人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"不要惧怕，因你必不致蒙羞；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不要抱愧，因你必不致受辱。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必忘记幼年的羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再记念你寡居的羞辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为造你的是你的丈夫；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华是他的名。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"救赎你的是以色列的圣者；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必称为全地之 神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华召你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如召被离弃心中忧伤的妻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是幼年所娶被弃的妻。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是你 神所说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我离弃你不过片时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却要施大恩将你收回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的怒气涨溢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"顷刻之间向你掩面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却要以永远的慈爱怜恤你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华—你的救赎主说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"这事在我好像挪亚的洪水。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎样起誓不再使挪亚的洪水漫过遍地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也照样起誓不再向你发怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不斥责你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大山可以挪开，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"小山可以迁移；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我的慈爱必不离开你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我平安的约也不迁移。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是怜恤你的耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的将来"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"你这受困苦、被风飘荡不得安慰的人哪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必以彩色安置你的石头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以蓝宝石立定你的根基；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又以红宝石造你的女墙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以红玉造你的城门，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以宝石造你四围的边界","poem":1},{"noteId":61},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的儿女都要受耶和华的教训；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的儿女必大享平安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必因公义得坚立，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必远离欺压，不致害怕；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必远离惊吓，惊吓必不临近你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即或有人聚集，却不由于我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡聚集攻击你的，必因你仆倒","poem":1},{"noteId":62},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吹嘘炭火、打造合用器械的铁匠是我所造；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"残害人、行毁灭的也是我所造。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡为攻击你造成的器械必不利用；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡在审判时兴起用舌攻击你的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必定他为有罪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华仆人的产业，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是他们从我所得的义。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":61,"caller":"-","text":"或译：外郭","reference":{"chapter":54,"verse":12}},{"noteId":62,"caller":"-","text":"或译：投降你","reference":{"chapter":54,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/54.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/55.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/53.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}